    @Gosub Path:Act01_Chapter02/Act01_Chapter02_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:1800
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 13: 💬 ゴクチョーの証言
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論2-13 ゴクチョーの証言
; BGM変更：Guil-me N'o sinruits-Vocal無-
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge2-13-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:请问，<br>各位想问我<br>什么问题？|#0102Trial13_Warden001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示・ナノカの鍵

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那，<br>可以问你<br>钥匙的事吗。|#0102Trial13_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【惩罚室的门】……<br>平时都是<br>锁着的吗？|#0102Trial13_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那是当然。|#0102Trial13_Warden002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"米莉亚小姐的<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_01\">人身束缚</link>，<br>还有房门的上锁<br>都是我们经手的。<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_02\">案件发生时</link><br>应该也是锁着的。|#0102Trial13_Warden003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不是，照你那么说<br>奈叶香就不可能有钥匙了啊。<br>当时门肯定<br>是开着的。|#0102Trial13_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你有再大的意见，<br>我也只能给这个回答……|#0102Trial13_Warden004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示：小さな鍵

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说起钥匙……<br>我们在房间里<br>找到了另一把<br>钥匙。|#0102Trial13_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这是什么<br>钥匙呢？|#0102Trial13_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这个……<br>大概是监牢内<br>收纳柜的钥匙吧。|#0102Trial13_Warden005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"是哪个房间里的<br>柜子钥匙来着……<br>总之<br>这并<link=\"Objection_01_02_13_04\">不是由我们管理的</link>。<br>不管怎样，<br>这钥匙<br>和惩罚室<link=\"Objection_01_02_13_03\">无关</link>。|#0102Trial13_Warden006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:为什么你<br>会不知道……！|#0102Trial13_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我们要管理的<br>事情有很多，<br>并不是所有事<br>都归我们管理。<br>|#0102Trial13_Warden007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:对了。<br>说起管理，<br>那张写了拷问秀的纸<br>是怎么回事？|#0102Trial13_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你说<br>应该没有事情<br>需要打开惩罚室……<br>那便条到底<br>是谁写的啊。|#0102Trial13_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"谁知道呢？<br>总之<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_05\">不是我们</link>。<br>今天并<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_06\">没有需要打开惩罚室的安排</link>。<br>我也<link=\"Objection_01_02_13_07\">没有下达这个指令</link>。<br>|#0102Trial13_Warden008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; アイテム表示・ミリアのスマホ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那……<br>你对手机<br>有什么<br>了解吗？|#0102Trial13_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:手电筒、<br>闹钟、<br>直播功能……<br>除了这些功能外，<br>还有什么其他的<br>特殊功能吗？|#0102Trial13_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:比如那种……<br>有助于杀害米莉亚的功能。|#0102Trial13_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:功能的话……<br>给各位配备的手机<br>虽然不能联系外界，<br>但是可以用它做很多事。|#0102Trial13_Warden009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只要知道手机专属的<br>ID（识别号码），<br>就能传信息和打电话……|#0102Trial13_Warden010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:手机里还装了很多APP，<br>可以直播和录音等等。<br>而且做工也很坚固，<br>不会轻易被弄坏。<br>总的来说是一部高性能的机器。|#0102Trial13_Warden011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但正因如此，手机容量比较大，<br>恢复出厂设置<br>需要相当长的时间。<br>不过我们在发给各位的时候<br>都是恢复出厂设置后<br>再发放的。|#0102Trial13_Warden012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"所以，<br>“只有某人的手机有<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_08\">特殊功能</link>”……<br>这种情况是不存在的，请放心。<br>还是说你们的手机<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_13_09\">出问题</link>了？|#0102Trial13_Warden013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是吗，<br>那就好。<br>要是装了<br>能催眠的APP<br>可就麻烦了。|#0102Trial13_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR13,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Comical_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:怎么可能<br>有那种玩意！|#0102Trial13_Coco004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

